  "description": "Soft watercolor pumpkin clipart bundle inspired by cozy autumn kitchens, rustic harvest aesthetics, warm bakery desserts, cottagecore fall decor, and elegant seasonal watercolor illustrations 🎃✨\nThe collection combines muted pumpkin tones, creamy neutrals, soft botanical details, and smooth painterly textures designed in a clean commercial watercolor style with simplified elegant forms and minimal visual clutter. Inside you’ll find pumpkins in different shapes and colors, autumn desserts, cozy drinks, farmhouse elements, botanical vines, pastries, breakfast scenes, and seasonal harvest illustrations with airy compositions and soft watercolor rendering.\n🎃 Perfect for:\n• Stickers & sticker sheets\n• Print on demand products (mugs, tote bags, t-shirts, candles, notebooks, phone cases)\n• Scrapbooking & journaling\n• Autumn invitations & greeting cards\n• Cottagecore branding & packaging\n• Digital planners & social media graphics\n• Printable wall art & seasonal decor\n💖 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🎃 Included illustrations: ceramic bowl with pumpkins, pumpkin spice latte, pumpkin pie slice, pumpkin pancakes, pumpkin wreath, pumpkin jam jar, pumpkin soup bowl, pumpkin plant with vines, pumpkin candle, basket with mini pumpkins, pumpkin teapot, pumpkin cheesecake, pumpkin macarons, autumn breakfast tray, pumpkin cookies, pumpkin milk bottle, pumpkin bread loaf, botanical pumpkin branch, pumpkin tart, standalone pumpkins in different colors and shapes.\nThis bundle is perfect for creating cozy fall collections, cottagecore stationery, bakery-inspired branding, rustic kitchen packaging, autumn stickers, seasonal décor, and elegant handmade products with a warm watercolor atmosphere. The illustrations are intentionally designed with simplified details, smooth shading, and clean closed silhouettes for beautiful print quality and easier vector tracing.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Soft watercolor pumpkin clipart bundle inspired by cozy autumn kitchens, rustic harvest aesthetics, warm bakery desserts, cottagecore fall decor, and elegant seasonal watercolor illustrations 🎃✨<br>\nThe collection combines muted pumpkin tones, creamy neutrals, soft botanical details, and smooth painterly textures designed in a clean commercial watercolor style with simplified elegant forms and minimal visual clutter. Inside you’ll find pumpkins in different shapes and colors, autumn desserts, cozy drinks, farmhouse elements, botanical vines, pastries, breakfast scenes, and seasonal harvest illustrations with airy compositions and soft watercolor rendering.</p>\n<p>🎃 Perfect for:<br>\n• Stickers &amp; sticker sheets<br>\n• Print on demand products (mugs, tote bags, t-shirts, candles, notebooks, phone cases)<br>\n• Scrapbooking &amp; journaling<br>\n• Autumn invitations &amp; greeting cards<br>\n• Cottagecore branding &amp; packaging<br>\n• Digital planners &amp; social media graphics<br>\n• Printable wall art &amp; seasonal decor</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🎃 Included illustrations: ceramic bowl with pumpkins, pumpkin spice latte, pumpkin pie slice, pumpkin pancakes, pumpkin wreath, pumpkin jam jar, pumpkin soup bowl, pumpkin plant with vines, pumpkin candle, basket with mini pumpkins, pumpkin teapot, pumpkin cheesecake, pumpkin macarons, autumn breakfast tray, pumpkin cookies, pumpkin milk bottle, pumpkin bread loaf, botanical pumpkin branch, pumpkin tart, standalone pumpkins in different colors and shapes.</p>\n<p>This bundle is perfect for creating cozy fall collections, cottagecore stationery, bakery-inspired branding, rustic kitchen packaging, autumn stickers, seasonal décor, and elegant handmade products with a warm watercolor atmosphere. The illustrations are intentionally designed with simplified details, smooth shading, and clean closed silhouettes for beautiful print quality and easier vector tracing.</p>",
